# Root .gitignore — applies repo-wide (patterns without a leading slash
# match at any depth, so this also covers agrismart-backend/ and
# agrismart-frontend/ without needing to touch their existing, working
# per-package .gitignore files).
#
# Phase 0 project-safety baseline. Nothing listed here is deleted from
# disk — these files remain exactly where they are; they are simply not
# tracked by Git.

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sw?

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.log
coverage/

# Build output
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local

# Playwright
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# Environment files — keep example/test config, exclude anything that
# could hold real secrets. `.env*` (no dot required after "env") is
# deliberately broader than `.env`/`.env.*` alone: a real incident
# during this project was a misnamed `.envGEMINI_API_KEY` file (typo'd
# while copying a real, populated .env) that contained a live
# MONGODB_URI and real JWT secrets and was NOT matched by `.env.*`
# (no dot after "env") — never tracked, but a real near-miss. This
# wider pattern catches that whole class of accidental filename typo.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.test

# Office temp/lock files (e.g. ".~AgriSmart_Investor_Pitch_Deck.pptx")
.~*.pptx
.~*.docx
.~*.xlsx

# Known cleanup debt (agrismart-frontend/_to_delete_*, agrismart-backend/_to_delete/)
# — intentionally left on disk per project instructions, just not
# tracked. Includes ad-hoc local debug/repro scripts that are not part
# of the real source tree.
_to_delete_*/
_to_delete/

# Prior-stage backend backup archives — superseded snapshots of the same
# codebase; kept on disk for reference, not tracked to avoid duplicating
# large binaries in history.
agrismart-backend-stage3*.zip

# Raw third-party AI training datasets (Arnesano field-trial data,
# Evolving Tomato Testbed, Mendeley tomato-irrigation dataset) — these
# are real research data downloaded from external sources whose
# redistribution license is unconfirmed (see DATASETS.md and
# AI_DATASET_INVENTORY.md: the Mendeley dataset's license is explicitly
# "not specified — treat as all-rights-reserved until verified", and
# the other two reference a LICENSE.txt from the original publisher
# that was never captured in this repo). Excluded from public
# distribution per an explicit decision on 2026-09-19; the code that
# ingests/trains on them (ai/external/adapters/*.js,
# ai/training/**/*.js) and the small hand-built structural fixtures in
# ai/external/adapters/fixtures/ are NOT affected by this rule and
# remain tracked. Re-download the originals from the URLs/DOIs in
# DATASETS.md to reproduce training locally.
agrismart-backend/ai/external/adapters/pending/**/*.csv

# Internal development-process logs (AI-assisted engineering session
# handoffs/audits) — historically useful locally but not appropriate
# for a public engineering repo (they narrate development sessions
# rather than document the system). Kept on disk, not tracked.
AGENTS.md
AGRISMART_HANDOFF_AUDIT.md
FINAL_REPORT.md
OVERNIGHT_COMMUNITY_REPORT.md
